      },
      {
        "native_id": "xc0249jpzf66",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "We've applied a mitigation and are seeing recovery across affected services, including Git operations, Issues, Actions, and API access. We're monitoring to confirm stability and will post another update by 00:35 UTC.",
